# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [PROMPT-00b] Generated artefacts — evidence, scratch venvs, superseded weights.
# Source modules are NEVER ignored. Deliberately NOT ignored here:
#   ais_service/test_output/  — tracked golden fixtures: the attribution
#     benchmark's truth.json set, and run.py:684 reads vessels.parquet from it.
#   docs/, Road-to-Production/ — carry build dependencies (docs/eval holdout
#     metrics for P01, docs/LIMITATIONS.md for P16); tracking is a pending call.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

